  "prompt": "Where did visitors come from on their first visit in July 2025? For each visitor with a session in July 2025 (session_start holds UTC time; 1 to 31 July, both days included, in UTC), take the visitor's first session in that month. When two sessions of a visitor tie on session_start, the one with the lower session_id counts as the first. Then count the visitors by the utm_source of that first session; a missing utm_source is a group of its own. Return two columns, in this order: utm_source and visitors. Return one row for each utm_source, the missing one included. Any row order is fine.",
